    "kill原非婚礼顺序wolfTeam.canVoteForKill→Night→tool name→args.abstain→首target null短路→bindWolfKnifeTargetQuery(world)callee→第二args.target→allows receiver。普通非pass且首target非null时3args/2target，原getter抛错只保已到前缀，不预读World名单或cache目标。",
    "self_destruct全部ctx属性仍在参数解构早取，包括allow；body婚礼setup/ready/member→角色capability→phase→窗口存在/Object.values成员→对应phase→allow局部→name/confirm；婚礼或失败保首拒绝，不加Role.Wolf标签/native来源门槛或假授权。",
    "狼刀组合四公开绑定依次创建只捕World，无实际状态查询；allows逐mist circle→noble双Role/政策→roster→evil→nightmare双Role/政策，member receiver及短路不改。新CN真实区分名单只读视图、对象浅freeze和World/名单未冻结。",
