    "普通assembly/runtime及ability public port共持同一可写map。实际派生spread仍捕原callback；Beauty.kill_vote每次读取WOLF_VALIDATION_RULES.kill_vote并member-call保表receiver，Wild captured callback不随新descriptor改变。Registry当前role晚规则与构造fallback原算法control全byte保。",
